OL,3,AFive EU countries announce migrant
OL,4,Adeportation centre in Rwanda
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive EU countries have announced a deal
OL,7,Fto establish a migrant deportation
OL,8,Fcentre in Rwanda as part of a broader
OL,9,Fpush to boost deportations and curb
OL,10,Firregular migration.
OL,12,FGermany, Denmark, Austria, Greece and
OL,13,Fthe Netherlands are expected to open a
OL,14,F"return hub" ready to accept transfers
OL,15,Fin 2027, the Dutch and Danish
OL,16,Fgovernments said.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
