OL,3,AFive EU countries announce migrant
OL,4,Adeportation centre in Rwanda
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe countries said the scheme would
OL,7,Fapply to migrants staying illegally in
OL,8,Fthe five EU nations who are subject to
OL,9,Fdeportation, with the Dutch government
OL,10,Fadding it will provide an alternative
OL,11,Fif deportees cannot be returned to
OL,12,Ftheir country of origin.
OL,14,FDeportees will be able to either
OL,15,Fintegrate into Rwandan society or
OL,16,Freturn to their home country, the
OL,17,Fnations said.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
